    "currency": "USD",
    "unit": "per 1,000,000 tokens",
    "verifiedAt": "2026-09-06",
    "notes": [
      "Every row carries the official page it was read from and the date it was checked.",
      "OpenAI and xAI publish an input price and a cached-input price, but no separate cache-write price: writing to cache is billed as ordinary input. Those rows therefore set cacheWrite = input, which is the billing behaviour, not a guess.",
      "Anthropic publishes cache write and cache read separately; both are copied verbatim.",
      "xAI prices by context length. The rows below are the sub-200k tier, which is what a CLI coding session is; a long-context session is billed at double and this table will under-report it.",
      "The CLI also fetches https://thetokentown.dev/pricing.json with a 24h cache, so corrections ship without a CLI release."
    ]
  },
